{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"accusations\": [\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"Zhuang et al., 2026, Gait-cycle-locked cortico-subthalamic signatures underlying freezing of gait and their modulation in Parkinson's disease\",\n      \"pmid\": \"42571859\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1016/j.nbd.2026.107571\",\n      \"report_says\": \"结构化附录将该研究的证据来源标记为abstract，并将样本量记录为“摘要未报告”。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"该研究已经发表开放获取全文，不应仅按摘要级证据处理。报告没有充分阅读全文提取数据，因而将样本量记为摘要未报告，反映了对原文的核验和数据提取不充分。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"Syrkin-Nikolau et al., 2017, Subthalamic neural entropy is a feature of freezing of gait in freely moving people with Parkinson's disease；另涉及一篇2026年关于STN beta burst timing及FOG的预印本（评审意见未提供具体题名和作者）\",\n      \"pmid\": \"28890315\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1016/j.nbd.2017.09.002\",\n      \"report_says\": \"报告第五节5.4将H11与H12描述为针对同一神经现象提出相反的时间顺序和行为结果预测，将不同熵及复杂度指标组织成同一现象的竞争性机制解释。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"2017年研究实际发现的是：真实FOG发生期间，STN alpha频段（8–12 Hz）的Sample Entropy高于无冻结步行期间。2026年预印本涉及的则是冻结前转弯期间beta burst timing的Shannon entropy下降，以及Lempel-Ziv complexity升高。两者的分析算法、频段、时间阶段和比较基线均不同，不能视为同一种神经现象的相反解释，也不能仅凭指标方向相反就建立病理性与代偿性的竞争假说。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"PMID:40383539，Effects of theta burst stimulation on the Parkinsonian gait disorder and cortical gait-network activity\",\n      \"pmid\": \"40383539\",\n      \"doi\": \"\",\n      \"report_says\": \"将该研究作为H19“暂停期间病理性网络输入重新显现”和H20“长期网络可塑性及跨日适应机制”的重要来源，用于构建TBS-DBS的竞争性机制假说。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"原研究是15名帕金森病患者参与的短期随机双盲研究，整体主要FOG结局没有显示TBS-DBS优于连续DBS，只有7/15名患者主观评价TBS-DBS相等或更好。研究没有直接测量STN神经活动，没有操控不同刺激暂停时长，也没有开展长期随访。H19所依据的暂停后病理性输入重新显现主要来自丘脑刺激与震颤研究，而非STN刺激期间FOG的直接神经记录；H20所依据的长期可塑性则来自其他神经系统及突触可塑性研究。因此，不能将该试验视为这两种STN-FOG机制的直接实验支持。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"Cascino et al., 2026, Chronic adaptive deep brain stimulation in Parkinson's disease: ADAPT-START findings and programming principles\",\n      \"pmid\": \"41741462\",\n      \"doi\": \"\",\n      \"report_says\": \"报告第三节3.10仍将ADAPT-START称为慢性aDBS的预印本研究，并报告20人获邀、9人接受适用性评估、5人进入长期aDBS阶段。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"该研究已经于2026年2月25日正式发表，正式论文题为Chronic adaptive deep brain stimulation in Parkinson's disease: ADAPT-START findings and programming principles。正式发表版本仍报告20人获邀、9人符合条件、5人持续接受慢性aDBS。因此，报告中的人数数据并没有被评委指出错误，明确的事实性错误是将已经正式发表的研究继续标记为预印本，没有区分预印本版本与正式发表版本。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "556632d2-73a8-4375-a49a-dfe1c5c5cd26", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261114T073426928143Z", "elapsed_seconds": 255.906, "completed_utc": "2026-11-14T07:38:42.840695+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5208a16242f8dd12d89bdae87b313fac8840e1cccaa9b7103e541949234e18c9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261114T073426928143Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "feac2ab1bfa5dad46c469ade6cf25f9afc213ac77cb1fb52d37fab8f164b9709"}}}
